@startditaa(scale=2)
RTPS message consists of header + N submessages

 0                    20              28              36        40
+--------------------+---------------+---------------+-----------+
|cBLU                |cGRE           |cGRE           |cPNK       |
|       HEADER       |   SUBMSG 1    |   SUBMSG 2    | ... / PAD |
|                    | 4B hdr + body | 4B hdr + body |           |
|        20B         |      8B       |      8B       |    4B     |
+--------------------+---------------+---------------+-----------+

+---------------------------------------------+
| UDP payload length is one RTPS message      |
| Each submessage starts on a 32 bit boundary |
| SubmessageHeader is 4 B. rest is body       |
+---------------------------------------------+

@endditaa
